---

This addon is built for IsoRim Waylith (https://github.com/peren717/IsoRim-1.7) and IsoRim ProjectZ, two separate mods
by their own authors. It ships none of their files and none of their code: every rule of theirs this addon needs is
hooked from this side with Harmony patches.

The deprecated PZ_Window / PZ_WindowWall window code and their defs were moved here from IsoRim ProjectZ so that saves
made with the earlier layouts keep loading. That code stays (c) Lin (peren717), MIT.

